WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:00.760
What's up guys!

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:01.720
We are Pongfinity

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.800
Today we are playing table tennis battleship!

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.100
First one to pop all five balloons wins

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.700
Let's go!

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:09.920
This is the first one

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:11.920
So scary

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.000
Last time I lost to Otto

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.380
But I'm smarter this time

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:19.980
I've got it all worked out

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.700
What's that sound?

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.840
Are there any spare balloons?

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.760
Because I think I might...

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:33.680
What happened there Emil?

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:34.380
Nothing!

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.180
So annoying!

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.860
Next one you blow up Emil you are not allowed to replace

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.140
Hi Otto!

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:47.620
This is the golden one

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:49.040
He will never pop this one

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.000
Keep your eyes on this one

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.640
Because this one will make it through the whole game

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.880
This is the golden one

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:03.620
He will never pop this one

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.480
Alright so there was a bit of an accident with the balloon

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.880
But we are back on track

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:15.240
Okay I hope we are finally ready!

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:16.320
Good luck Emil!

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:17.540
Good luck Miikka!

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.240
This is always so nervous!

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:21.440
This is yeah!

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.600
Am I even gonna hit the table?

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:27.900
No, you don't hit the table!

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:33.960
Two!

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:34.980
Double shot!

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:37.520
It sounded like a double pop

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:38.680
No!

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.360
Not even close Emil!

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.580
I think it was quite close!

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.200
How am I not hitting them?

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:51.940
That was actually really close!

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:52.500
Was it?

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:53.560
Are you bluffing or?

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:54.640
I don't know!

00:01:57.900 --> 00:01:59.800
That was really close!

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.220
How does he know where my balls are?

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:08.360
3-0!

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:10.900
I actually think it's somewhere...

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.880
It's a long one maybe!

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.920
Now I'll start popping them

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:19.100
Or not!

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.140
Emil do you even have any balls over
there?

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:33.660
I might have put some under the table!

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:38.300
Yes!

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:40.360
I got one!

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.460
I had to give him one

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.080
The square to Emil's right

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:45.040
Right on the edge

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.320
I didn't hit it, did I?

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:01.200
I feel that it's somewhere there

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.640
But I haven't just hit it yet

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.460
I still think it's in this corner

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.380
Or no, this corner

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:06.900
Short!

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.160
Who is gonna hit it first?

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:20.680
Yes!

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:28.100
Okay you touched it

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:31.520
That was the second time Emil touched that ball

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:32.320
Really?

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:33.520
Second time?

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:37.240
Why didn't I get the pop from the
first one already?

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:38.720
Okay you got that one Emil!

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:39.440
Thanks

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:42.120
3-1!

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.220
One more to go!

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:46.680
I'm pretty sure it has to be a short one

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.560
And I think it's on the right side too

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:51.960
Maybe middle short?

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:56.400
He is may be onto something

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:00.680
No, it's not under the table Emil

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:01.980
It's gotta be long far

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.260
No!

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:06.600
What happened there Emil?

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:08.320
Nothing!

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:10.140
Did it touch the balloon?

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.080
Ah okay... well now I know where it is!

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:16.320
Not even close Emil!

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:19.640
Okay now you hit it!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.840
That was a jackpot

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:26.700
It definitely was a jackpot!

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.780
Yeah... okay

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.400
Okay now we are both down to the last balloon

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.320
So it's a perfect time for you guys to hit subscribe!

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:43.520
It's down to the final balloon Emil!

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:01.320
No!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.360
Yes!

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:03.460
Come on!

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:06.480
Finally I found it!

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.360
It was somewhere here, right?

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:09.180
It was this one

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:10.280
Oh it was this one?

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:11.120
It was that one yeah

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:13.720
Okay hope you guys enjoyed this balloon battle!

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.540
Next time it will be me against Otto

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.180
The winners play against each other!

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:19.000
Until next time!

